
#Authorization Endpoints

#api call for creating user account
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/register/ 
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user",
    "email":"user@gmail.com",
    "password":"Password@123"
}

#api call for generete token
###
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/token/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username":"user",
    "password":"Password@123"
}




#api call for cur user data
###
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/v1/spending/me/
Accept: application/json
Authorization: Token 8937be4ca8a1a075a38218681cd536fbf6a737a7

